  "post_content": "<p>(9 fotos) Poc abans de les 5 d&#39;aquesta matinada de dilluns s&#39;ha declarat un incendi a la part superior de la casa del n&uacute;mero 46, al carrer Cam&iacute; de Castell&oacute;, al centre hist&ograve;ric d&#39;Onda, on s&#39;ubica el casal d&#39;una penya. En eixe moment no hi havia ning&uacute;, pel qual no hi ha danys personals. S&#39;han cremat un sof&agrave; i mobles d&#39;una habitaci&oacute;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/BombersCamiCastello.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Han actuat Policia Local, Gu&agrave;rdia Civil, 4 bombers voluntaris del parc Espad&agrave; Millars d&#39;Onda i ha arribat una dotaci&oacute; de professionals de Nules quan el foc ja estava extingit, de manera que nom&eacute;s han hagut de revisar l&#39;edifici. Poc despr&eacute;s de les 6.15 hores han acabat el servei.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8329.jpg\" alt=\"img_8329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8330.jpg\" alt=\"img_8330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8332.jpg\" alt=\"img_8332\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8333.jpg\" alt=\"img_8333\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8334.jpg\" alt=\"img_8334\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8335.jpg\" alt=\"img_8335\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8336.jpg\" alt=\"img_8336\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendietcasalcamicastello/img_8337.jpg\" alt=\"img_8337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
